# Alignment independence: the decompressors use plain (unaligned-tolerant) loads, so planes placed at
# an arbitrary byte offset inside their buffer give the same result as aligned planes.
# The trailing argument is the offset of every input plane from a 32-byte aligned address (0 = aligned).
decompress 420 0 2 4 2 2 16 2 0102030405060708 aabb ccdd 0
decompress 420 0 2 4 2 2 16 2 0102030405060708 aabb ccdd 1
decompress 420 0 2 4 2 2 16 2 0102030405060708 aabb ccdd 3
decompress 420 0 2 4 2 2 16 2 0102030405060708 aabb ccdd 15
decompress nv12 0 2 4 4 0 16 2 0102030405060708 aa11bb22 - 0
decompress nv12 0 2 4 4 0 16 2 0102030405060708 aa11bb22 - 1
decompress nv12 0 2 4 4 0 16 2 0102030405060708 aa11bb22 - 7
decompress422 lead 0 1 4 16 1 aabbccdd11223344 0
decompress422 lead 0 1 4 16 1 aabbccdd11223344 1
decompress422 trail 0 1 4 16 1 aabbccdd11223344 0
decompress422 trail 0 1 4 16 1 aabbccdd11223344 3
